# Journey Abroad in Windurst Woods with the mission current and Journey to Windurst completed. Catalia, Erpolant, Forine
# and Mourices are triggered at status 0, 1, 3, 6, 7, 8, 10 and 11 (Mourices not at 6). At status 7: Catalia 459,
# Erpolant 460, Forine 461 and Mourices 458; at 11 Mourices plays 468; otherwise the zone's own: Catalia 442, Erpolant
# 447, Forine 446, Mourices 441. The login in Windurst Woods also plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 839, whose
# finish sets SoA status 4.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Ambrotien/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/2009 NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/505 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/507 Metalworks/Chantain/onTrigger Metalworks/Lutia/onTrigger Metalworks/Riault/onTrigger Metalworks/Savae_E_Paleade/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/204 Metalworks/onEventFinish/206 WindurstWoods/Catalia/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Erpolant/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Forine/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Mourices/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/448 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/462
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-50.6,-0.5,-27.6 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=0
mission Sandoria JourneyToWindurst completed
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria JourneyAbroad current
login
